    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis quaint, two bedroom cottage has been tastefully renovated and extended resulting in a fabulous countryside home. Set on a 0.51 acre private and secure site with beautiful walled in gardens and patio areas featuring rose hedges and fruit trees such as apple, pears, plums an fig trees, this property would make an ideal holiday or retirement home. Internally, the cottage is presented for sale in excellent condition throughout with traditional features such as casement style windows and doors maintained and respected. Accommodation comprises 92 sq.m. and includes an open plan kitchen and dining area, sitting room, hallway, utility area, bathroom and two bedrooms. External features include, meticulously maintained garden areas, plentiful fruit trees, a large fish pond, an electric car charging point, a storage shed, fuel shed and traditional stone boundary walls. Early viewings are advisable to appreciate what is on offer. BER E."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nA bright and inviting entrance hallway complete with tiled flooring, recessed storage closet and access to attic.\n\nUtility Room - \nAn ideal use of a compact space! Fully plumbed with washing machine, tumble dryer and an additional sink\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - \nOpen plan, beautifully fitted, country style solid wood kitchen. Complete with granite tops, breakfast counter, integrated appliances and a casement style picture window overlooking the fabulous gardens.French doors lead to an external patio and seating area.\n\nSitting Room - \nCosy living room complete with solid oak flooring, an attractive Quartz fireplace with an elevated fitted wood pellett stove, tv point and a lovely window seat with built in storage.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nThis double bedroom has a dual aspect and is complete with wood effect tiled flooring, a built in wardrobe and recessed hot press.\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled in neutral tones and complete with shower, wc and whb.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nThis master bedroom has a dual aspect and is complete with wood effect tiled flooring, a walk in closet and casement style windows overlooking the garden area\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Beautifully presented 2 bedroom cottage</li><li>Ideal holiday or retirement home</li><li>Peaceful and tranquil setting</li><li>Lovely countryside views and lots of local bogwalks</li><li>Located 10kms from Kilkee and 3kms from Carrigaholt</li><li>Fantastic, secure and private garden areas</li><li>Adjacent walled in patio and seating area</li><li>Traditional features maintained</li><li>Electrci car charging point</ul>"
      },
